# Design system

Tokens live in `src/styles/tokens.css`. Use CSS variables — do not hardcode one-off palette values in components.

## Direction

- Cool slate atmosphere, jade accent (`--accent`), intimate letter feel
- Display: Fraunces · Body: Source Serif 4 · UI: DM Sans
- Motion: rise-in, stagger, entry progress — respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Composition

- Home first viewport: brand (logo + Leonardo Sforza) + one line + CTA group only
- No cards in the hero; cards only when they aid browsing (letter/entry lists)
- Avoid: purple gradients, cream+terracotta defaults, broadsheet hairline layouts, Inter/Roboto/system-only stacks, emoji decoration spam

## Brand

Logo slot: `public/brand/logo.svg`. Keep header brand name hero-visible; do not demote the name to tiny nav-only text on marketing surfaces.
